Chio includes a modified copy of the upstream crate under
`third_party/seccompiler-chio`. Chio changed `src/lib.rs` to reject filter
lengths that do not fit the kernel `sock_fprog` length field (with one
documentation indentation fix), added regression tests to
`tests/integration_tests.rs`, marked both manifests unpublished and standalone,
added a tracked `Cargo.lock` (removing it from `.gitignore`), and normalized
